    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p14-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2+x-2}{x^2-x-20}\\times\\dfrac{x^2+5x+4}{x^2-x}\\div\\left(\\dfrac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2-2x-15}\\times\\dfrac{x+3}{x^2}\\right)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x$\n\nFactorise, multiply by the reciprocal of the complete divisor, and cancel common factors.",
          "worked": "Factorise each quadratic, then multiply by the reciprocal of the bracketed product.\n$$\\begin{align*}&\\mathrel{\\phantom{=}}\\frac{x^2+x-2}{x^2-x-20}\\times\\frac{x^2+5x+4}{x^2-x}\\div\\left(\\frac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2-2x-15}\\times\\frac{x+3}{x^2}\\right)\\\\&=\\frac{(x+2)(x-1)}{(x-5)(x+4)}\\times\\frac{(x+1)(x+4)}{x(x-1)}\\\\&\\quad\\times\\frac{(x-5)(x+3)}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\times\\frac{x^2}{x+3}\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$\nThe original expression requires $x\\ne-4,-3,-2,-1,0,1,5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2-64}{x^2+24x+128}\\times\\dfrac{x^2+12x-64}{x^2-16}\\div\\dfrac{x^2-16x+64}{x^2-10x+16}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x-2}{x+4}$\n\nFactorise each quadratic and multiply by the reciprocal before cancelling.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}&\\mathrel{\\phantom{=}}\\frac{x^2-64}{x^2+24x+128}\\times\\frac{x^2+12x-64}{x^2-16}\\div\\frac{x^2-16x+64}{x^2-10x+16}\\\\&=\\frac{(x-8)(x+8)}{(x+8)(x+16)}\\times\\frac{(x+16)(x-4)}{(x-4)(x+4)}\\times\\frac{(x-8)(x-2)}{(x-8)^2}\\\\&=\\frac{x-2}{x+4}\\end{align*}$$\nThe original expression requires $x\\ne-16,-8,-4,2,4,8$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 57
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2-18x+80}{x^2-5x-50}\\times\\dfrac{x^2-6x-7}{x^2-15x+56}\\div\\dfrac{x-1}{x+5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+1}{x-1}$\n\nFactorise each quadratic and multiply by the reciprocal before cancelling.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}&\\mathrel{\\phantom{=}}\\frac{x^2-18x+80}{x^2-5x-50}\\times\\frac{x^2-6x-7}{x^2-15x+56}\\div\\frac{x-1}{x+5}\\\\&=\\frac{(x-10)(x-8)}{(x-10)(x+5)}\\times\\frac{(x-7)(x+1)}{(x-7)(x-8)}\\times\\frac{x+5}{x-1}\\\\&=\\frac{x+1}{x-1}\\end{align*}$$\nThe original expression requires $x\\ne-5,1,7,8,10$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 57
      }
    ]
